    "description": "This delicious and tender dish will wow fans of both barbecue chicken and grilled chicken. In this video, Chef John shows you how to make Filipino-style barbecue chicken with his homemade banana ketchup recipe. After first refrigerating and marinating the chicken thighs in the banana ketchup overnight, place the chicken on skewers. Now, create the basting sauce with the banana ketchup, brown sugar, soy sauce, asian fish sauce, and vegetable oil. Finally, grill each side of the chicken evenly while brushing the basting sauce onto the meat. ",
